(doc
  (title "Swift Implementation Build Steps")
  (source-format markdown)
  (converted "2026-07-19")
  (para "Build steps for creating the YX protocol Swift implementation.")
  (section
    (heading "Overview")
    (para "These steps guide the AI agent through building a complete Swift implementation of the YX protocol, including:")
    (item "Core protocol (packet building, parsing, HMAC)")
    (item "Transport layer (UDP, Swift concurrency)")
    (item "Protocol handlers (Text Protocol 0, Binary Protocol 1)")
    (item "Security (CryptoKit HMAC-SHA256, AES-GCM, compression)")
    (item "Comprehensive tests (XCTest)")
    (item "Canonical artifact validation"))
  (section
    (heading "Step Sequence")
    (para "Steps will be created in order:")
    (item "1. **Project Setup** - Create Swift Package, Package.swift")
    (item "2. **Packet Core** - Packet struct, GUIDFactory")
    (item "3. **Packet Builder** - Build, parse, validate packets")
    (item "4. **HMAC Security** - CryptoKit HMAC-SHA256")
    (item "5. **Encryption** - CryptoKit AES-GCM")
    (item "6. **Compression** - Compression framework")
    (item "7. **UDP Transport** - NWConnection/BSD sockets, async/await")
    (item "8. **Text Protocol** - Protocol 0 handler")
    (item "9. **Binary Protocol** - Protocol 1 handler (v2.0 with channels)")
    (item "10. **Protocol Router** - Route packets to correct handler")
    (item "11. **Security Components** - RateLimiter, ReplayProtection, KeyStore")
    (item "12. **Unit Tests** - XCTest for all components")
    (item "13. **Integration Tests** - End-to-end flows")
    (item "14. **Network Tests** - UDP broadcast validation")
    (item "15. **Canonical Validation** - Validate against Python-generated test vectors")
    (item "16. **Documentation** - README, DocC documentation")
    (item "17. **Final Verification** - All tests pass, interop tests pass"))
  (section
    (heading "Target Build Directory")
    (para "`../../builds/swift-impl/`"))
  (section
    (heading "Traceability")
    (para "All steps implement specifications from:")
    (item "`../../protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp` - Protocol specification")
    (item "`../../protocol/specs/testing/testing-strategy.sxp` - Testing requirements")
    (item "`../../protocol/specs/architecture/implementation-languages.sxp` - Language guidance"))
  (section
    (heading "Canonical Artifact Validation")
    (para "**Critical Step:** Swift implementation validates against canonical test vectors")
    (para "Input from: `../../canonical/test-vectors/`")
    (para "All test vectors generated by Python implementation MUST parse correctly and produce identical results."))
  (section
    (heading "Wire Format Compatibility")
    (para "Swift implementation MUST produce byte-identical packets to Python implementation for the same inputs. This is verified through:")
    (item "1. Canonical test vector validation")
    (item "2. Interop tests (Python ↔ Swift message exchange)")
    (item "3. HMAC comparison tests"))
  (section
    (heading "Current Status")
    (para "Steps not yet created. Will be added as part of YBS system development."))
  (section
    (heading "Dependencies")
    (para "Swift steps assume:")
    (item "Python implementation exists (for canonical test vectors)")
    (item "Canonical test vectors have been generated")
    (item "Reference packets available for validation")))
